docs/release-macos.md

# Private business plan and cohort strategy
docs/business-plan-cohorts.md

# CodeGraph local index
.codegraph/

# A symlink named node_modules (a worktree borrowing another checkout's packages) is a file, which the folder pattern above misses.
node_modules
# Windows builds made by hand, waiting to be uploaded
windows builds/

# The feedback reports: the server (deploy/feedback/.env) and the screenshots pulled from it are local.
deploy/feedback/.env
deploy/feedback/feedback-screenshots/
